<title>FRANCE: 18 hurt as French merry-go-round collapses.</title>
<headline>18 hurt as French merry-go-round collapses.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen people were injured on Saturday when a merry-go-round in a funfair collapsed at Tarare, near Lyon in central France, police said.</p>
<p>They said none of the victims, aged eight to 20, was badly hurt. The state prosecutor opened a probe to determine what caused the accident.</p>
